# Angular Guidelines

Use Angular 21.

Prefer:
- standalone components
- signals
- computed()
- signal-based state
- new Angular control flow
- inject()
- typed reactive forms where appropriate
- Angular Material 3

Avoid:
- NgModules
- unnecessary RxJS state management
- global mutable state
- unnecessary abstractions
- premature component libraries

Use feature-based organization.

Components should remain focused.
Business rules belong in services/domain/backend, not templates.